    "pre_update_notes": "A patch on top of 2.0.4: more reliable pre-update backups on very large catalogs, plus stand-alone custom invoices. It applies 1 small additive database migration (a new custom_invoices table and 3 new admin permissions) \u2014 nothing in your products, orders or customers is touched. Note: the backup improvements take effect once this release is installed, so the pre-update backup of THIS update still runs on 2.0.4's code; update from a single browser tab and leave the update page open until it finishes.",
    "post_update_notes": "After the update: super admins can use Invoices \u2192 Custom invoices straight away. To let other roles use it, grant them 'view custom invoices', 'create custom invoices' and 'edit custom invoices' under Roles. The bank-transfer details you configured now also appear on invoices. In System \u2192 Backups you can now select several backups and delete them in one go.",
